in every industry there is some company  that really makes a difference and in  every one of those companies there's a  leader who really mattered our vision  and the Stanford executive program is to  help you become that leader our  curriculum will bring you to the cutting  edge in the latest thinking on business  excellence design thinking big data the  latest in financial engineering  strategic management methods for  innovation the faculty at the Stanford  Business School focus on why companies  win how public policy shapes the success  and failure of economies how people in  their careers change how negotiations  improve or hurt the chances of a  business how groups and teams operate  effectively to get the job done helping  you to understand what will make a  difference for you as a leader and for  your company as a competitor our  approach to learning and the Stanford  executive program relies on a great deal  of collaboration as you together with  the other executives in the program  share your experiences you'll carry with  you the network that you create when  you're here so that over your career  your relationships worldwide in a  business community will be enriched by  the six weeks that you had here  you will be changed by your experience  here in the short run you will have  specific plans and tools that you can  execute on Monday morning when you  return to work and in the long run your  career and your business will go on to a  different trajectory because of the  techniques and ideas that you learn  we're excited about the directions your  career will be taking we look forward to  seeing you here at Sam
 

